OL,3,GNEWSAExecutive to meet again over
OL,4,Abudget offer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe executive will hold further talks
OL,7,Fwith the secretary of state on Friday
OL,8,Fto discuss the government's offer of
OL,9,Fmoney to resolve Stormont's budget
OL,10,Fdeadlock.
OL,12,FOn Monday, Sir Chris Bryant visited
OL,13,FStormont and made an initial offer of
OL,14,F#350m per year over the next three
OL,15,Fyears to help stabilise the executive's
OL,16,Ffinances.
OL,18,FBut executive parties said that did not
OL,19,Fgo far enough and suggested that the
OL,20,Fgovernment would need to increase its
OL,21,Fcontribution in order for Stormont to
OL,22,Fbalance its books this year.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
